  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "A maintenance release. The dashboard now works on Umbraco 16 to 18: it read its token from the Umbraco 13 backoffice global, so every request came back 401. System.Security.Cryptography.Xml and System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs are pinned to 10.0.14 for advisories published in October 2026; the package uses neither and pins them only because Umbraco brings in vulnerable versions. No API, configuration or schema changes. Full changelog: https://github.com/BaryoDev/umbraco-pwa/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
